farmland-atlas/louisiana/vernon-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Vernon Parish has 75 years on the record, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids May to June and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had November to December at 55% and September to October at 72%. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids shows May to June at 142%. Grid 13347 had its driest year in 1954, at 58%.</p>"}
